      "content": "self-care routines? i dont even have the energy to brush my teeth most days. it feels like you're suggesting i put a bandaid on a gaping wound. the pain isn't just a feeling, it's like i'm physically drowning in it. sometimes i just sit here and think... if i didn't have to wake up to this silence every morning, maybe it wouldn't hurt so much. it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just... stop.",
